        _position: {x: 2.4, y: -79.2}
        _nextNodeIndex: 13
        _choiceDatas: []
        _text: Hi, I will introduce about a Dialogue Tool! This tool will help with
          bubble chat style!
        _textBoxType: 0
        _talkingEmotion: 0
        _isHaveCallBack: 0
        _groupDataIndex: 0
      - _name: Node 4
        _index: 4
        _position: {x: 828, y: -132}
        _nextNodeIndex: -1
        _choiceDatas:
        - _text: Let talking with surprise bubble chat!
          _nextNodeIndex: 5
        - _text: Let thinking something.
          _nextNodeIndex: 6
        - _text: Nah, just continue like normal.
          _nextNodeIndex: 7
        _text: First, this is a example for a choosing system. Let choosing something.
        _textBoxType: 0
        _talkingEmotion: 0
        _isHaveCallBack: 0
        _groupDataIndex: 0
      - _name: Node 5
        _index: 5
        _position: {x: 1328.8, y: -630.39996}
        _nextNodeIndex: 15
        _choiceDatas: []
        _text: You mean the bubble chat will display like this?
        _textBoxType: 1
        _talkingEmotion: 2
        _isHaveCallBack: 0
        _groupDataIndex: 0
      - _name: Node 6
        _index: 6
        _position: {x: 1328.8, y: -364}
        _nextNodeIndex: 15
        _choiceDatas: []
        _text: Hmmmm I will think about what will the bubble chat display...
        _textBoxType: 2
        _talkingEmotion: 3
        _isHaveCallBack: 0
        _groupDataIndex: 0
      - _name: Node 7
        _index: 7
        _position: {x: 1328.8, y: -60}
        _nextNodeIndex: 15
        _choiceDatas: []
        _text: Okay... this is normal dialogue's bubble chat
        _textBoxType: 0
        _talkingEmotion: 3
        _isHaveCallBack: 0
        _groupDataIndex: 0
      - _name: Node 8
        _index: 8
        _position: {x: 2282.4, y: -60}
        _nextNodeIndex: 16
        _choiceDatas: []
        _text: I haven't finished yet, the bubble chat can be also dynamic reposition
          depend to where we are!
        _textBoxType: 0
        _talkingEmotion: 0
        _isHaveCallBack: 0
        _groupDataIndex: 0
      - _name: Node 9
        _index: 9
        _position: {x: 3166.4, y: -57.6}
        _nextNodeIndex: 10
        _choiceDatas: []
        _text: Yeah! It's also can be scaled to any size depend on the text we input
          to the node of bubble chat!
        _textBoxType: 0
        _talkingEmotion: 3
        _isHaveCallBack: 0
        _groupDataIndex: 0
      - _name: Node 10
        _index: 10
        _position: {x: 3599.2, y: -57.6}
        _nextNodeIndex: 17
        _choiceDatas: []
        _text: Addtionally, holding "TALK" button will speed up the text too!
        _textBoxType: 0
        _talkingEmotion: 0
        _isHaveCallBack: 0
        _groupDataIndex: 0
      - _name: Node 11
        _index: 11
        _position: {x: 5661.6, y: -70.399994}
        _nextNodeIndex: 21
        _choiceDatas: []
        _text: STOP SPAM!
        _textBoxType: 1
        _talkingEmotion: 2
        _isHaveCallBack: 0
        _groupDataIndex: 0
      - _name: Node 12
        _index: 12
        _position: {x: 6462.4, y: -70.399994}
        _nextNodeIndex: 22
        _choiceDatas: []
        _text: 'By the way, when you have , . ? ! in the text, the text render speed
